give @s written_book[written_book_content={pages:[["", {"text": "\n\n\n   BLOOD ON THE\n    CLOCKTOWER", "bold": true}, "\n", {"text": "  \"Calls Casting\"", "italic": true, "color": "dark_red"}, "\n", {"text": "ROLE CHEAT SHEET", "bold": true}, "\n\n\n\n* next to ability means Not the First Night."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "TOWNSFOLK", "bold": true, "color": "dark_blue"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Knight", "color": "dark_blue", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_blue"}, "\nYou start knowing 2 players that are not the Demon."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "TOWNSFOLK", "bold": true, "color": "dark_blue"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Shugenja", "color": "dark_blue", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_blue"}, "\nYou start knowing if your closest evil player is clockwise or anti-clockwise. If equidistant, this info is arbitrary."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "TOWNSFOLK", "bold": true, "color": "dark_blue"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Balloonist", "color": "dark_blue", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_blue"}, "\nEach night, you learn a player of a different character type than last night. [+0 or +1 Outsider]"],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "TOWNSFOLK", "bold": true, "color": "dark_blue"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Fortune Teller", "color": "dark_blue", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_blue"}, "\nEach night, choose 2 players: you learn if either is a Demon. There is a good player that registers as a Demon to you."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "TOWNSFOLK", "bold": true, "color": "dark_blue"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Flowergirl", "color": "dark_blue", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_blue"}, "\nEach night*, you learn if a Demon voted today."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "TOWNSFOLK", "bold": true, "color": "dark_blue"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Acrobat", "color": "dark_blue", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_blue"}, "\nEach night*, choose a player: if they are or become drunk or poisoned tonight, you die."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "TOWNSFOLK", "bold": true, "color": "dark_blue"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Savant", "color": "dark_blue", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_blue"}, "\nEach day, you may visit the Storyteller to learn 2 things in private: 1 is true & 1 is false."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "TOWNSFOLK", "bold": true, "color": "dark_blue"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Seamstress", "color": "dark_blue", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_blue"}, "\nOnce per game, at night, choose 2 players (not yourself): you learn if they are the same alignment."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "TOWNSFOLK", "bold": true, "color": "dark_blue"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Professor", "color": "dark_blue", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_blue"}, "\nOnce per game, at night*, choose a dead player: if they are a Townsfolk, they are resurrected."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "TOWNSFOLK", "bold": true, "color": "dark_blue"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Slayer", "color": "dark_blue", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_blue"}, "\nOnce per game, during the day, publicly choose a player: if they are the Demon, they die."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "TOWNSFOLK", "bold": true, "color": "dark_blue"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Sage", "color": "dark_blue", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_blue"}, "\nIf the Demon kills you, you learn that it is 1 of 2 players."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "TOWNSFOLK", "bold": true, "color": "dark_blue"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Tea Lady", "color": "dark_blue", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_blue"}, "\nIf both your alive neighbors are good, they can't die."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "TOWNSFOLK", "bold": true, "color": "dark_blue"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Fool", "color": "dark_blue", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_blue"}, "\nThe 1st time you die, you don't."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "TOWNSFOLK", "bold": true, "color": "dark_blue"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Poppy Grower", "color": "dark_blue", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_blue"}, "\nMinions & Demons do not know each other. If you die, they learn who each other are that night."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "OUTSIDER", "bold": true, "color": "dark_blue"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Ogre", "color": "dark_blue", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_blue"}, "\nOn your 1st night, choose a player (not yourself): you become their alignment (you don't know which) even if drunk or poisoned."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "OUTSIDER", "bold": true, "color": "dark_blue"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Lunatic", "color": "dark_blue", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_blue"}, "\nYou think you are a Demon, but you are not. The Demon knows who you are & who you choose at night."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "OUTSIDER", "bold": true, "color": "dark_blue"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Drunk", "color": "dark_blue", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_blue"}, "\nYou do not know you are the Drunk. You think you are a Townsfolk character, but you are not."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "OUTSIDER", "bold": true, "color": "dark_blue"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Recluse", "color": "dark_blue", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_blue"}, "\nYou might register as evil & as a Minion or Demon, even if dead."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "OUTSIDER", "bold": true, "color": "dark_blue"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Puzzlemaster", "color": "dark_blue", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_blue"}, "\n1 player is drunk, even if you die. If you guess (once) who it is, learn the Demon player, but guess wrong & get false info."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "MINION", "bold": true, "color": "dark_red"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Marionette", "color": "dark_red", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_red"}, "\nYou think you are a good character, but you are not. The Demon knows who you are. [You neighbor the Demon]"],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "MINION", "bold": true, "color": "dark_red"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Summoner", "color": "dark_red", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_red"}, "\nYou get 3 bluffs. On the 3rd night, choose a player: they become an evil Demon of your choice. [No Demon]"],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "DEMON", "bold": true, "color": "dark_red"}, "\n\n", {"text": "No Dashii", "color": "dark_red", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_red"}, "\nEach night*, choose a player: they die. Your 2 Townsfolk neighbors are poisoned."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "DEMON", "bold": true, "color": "dark_red"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Imp", "color": "dark_red", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_red"}, "\nEach night*, choose a player: they die. If you kill yourself this way, a Minion becomes the Imp."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "DEMON", "bold": true, "color": "dark_red"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Po", "color": "dark_red", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_red"}, "\nEach night*, you may choose a player: they die. If your last choice was no-one, choose 3 players tonight."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "DEMON", "bold": true, "color": "dark_red"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Zombuul", "color": "dark_red", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_red"}, "\nEach night*, if no-one died today, choose a player: they die. The 1st time you die, you live but register as dead."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "DEMON", "bold": true, "color": "dark_red"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Vortox", "color": "dark_red", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_red"}, "\nEach night*, choose a player: they die. Townsfolk abilities yield false info. Each day, if no-one is executed, evil wins."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "DEMON", "bold": true, "color": "dark_red"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Fang Gu", "color": "dark_red", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_red"}, "\nEach night*, choose a player: they die. The 1st Outsider this kills becomes an evil Fang Gu & you die instead. [+1 Outsider]"],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "FABLED", "bold": true, "color": "gold"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Sentinel", "color": "gold", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "gold"}, "\nThere might be 1 extra or 1 fewer Outsider in play."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "FABLED", "bold": true, "color": "gold"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Djinn", "color": "gold", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "gold"}, "\nUse the Djinn's special rule. All players know what it is. (Speak with Storyteller)"],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "LORIC", "bold": true, "color": "dark_green"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Bootlegger", "color": "dark_green", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_green"}, "\nThis script has homebrew characters or rules.\n1. The Summoner must be in play and may summon on Night 1. When the Summoner summons their Demon, one of their neighbours is randomly chosen to become their Marionette.\n..."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "LORIC", "bold": true, "color": "dark_green"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Bootlegger", "color": "dark_green", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_green"}, "\n2. If a lunatic is in play, they are initially given a townsfolk or outsider role. Then, on Night 1, they are informed that they are the demon.\n..."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "LORIC", "bold": true, "color": "dark_green"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Bootlegger", "color": "dark_green", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_green"}, "\n3. (Optionial) The Ballonist uses the old role description: \"Each night, you learn 1 player of each character type, until there are no more types to learn. [+1 Outsider]\""]],title:"Script Roles",author:""},custom_name=[{"text": "Calls Casting Script", "italic": false, "color": "dark_red", "underlined": true, "bold": true}],lore=[[{"text": "Useful role cheat sheet for ", "italic": false, "color": "gray"}], [{"text": "\"Calls Casting\"", "italic": false, "color": "dark_red"}, {"text": " script.", "italic": false, "color": "gray"}]]]